## If Ben Ramsey left (`--without "Ben Ramsey"`)
- **Lines lost:** 3,518 of 5,617 (62.6%) go with him.
- **Files without their main author:** he is the top owner of 44 of the 64 files (4,358 lines). The largest are `tests/CollectionManipulationTest.php`, `src/AbstractCollection.php`, `src/DoubleEndedQueueInterface.php`, `src/CollectionInterface.php` and `src/Map/AbstractMap.php`.
