- **Bus factor:** 1 today, measured as the fewest authors whose lines reach 50%. To reach 80% takes 3 authors, or 4 counting blank lines. Without Ben it would be 3, counted on the lines the others hold. Counting only the lines of the 3 active people, he alone holds over half.
- **Who would inherit most:** icanhazstring (609 lines in 20 files), Carlos C Soto (332 lines in 18 files) and Kévin Gomez (327 lines in 4 files). None of them has committed since 2019 or earlier, so the receiving team would effectively start from scratch. The only active contributor with real lines is Tomasz Wrona, at 1.9%.

